  <content>
    <section>
      <media alt="Arm skeletal system">
        <image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/Algebra-1_03_09_02_01.png" />
      </media>

      <para>An anthropologist finds a fossilized humerus bone of an ancient human ancestor. The
        humerus is an arm bone running from the shoulder to the elbow. It is 24 centimeters in
        length. Use data from your classmates to estimate the height of this ancient human.</para>
    </section>
  </content>
